   2009},
Organization = {Intelligent Informat Technol Applicat Res Assoc; Indt Geodesy \&
   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {The water quality of groundwater in Jining has been assessed
   comprehensively based on the environmental investigation and monitoring
   in order to provide the scientific basis for the pollution treatment in
   the Jining city. This paper discussed the choice of the evaluated
   factors, the operations of the weight value, and compares with the
   status of the water quality in the course of the evaluation. The
   conclusions indicated that the result of the fuzzy mathematics
   evaluation represented the water quality of groundwater in Jining city.
   The evaluation result was compared with that of the traditional method
   and the reported results in Jining. It is indicated that the performance
   of the proposed model is practically feasible in the application of
   groundwater quality assessment and its application is simple.},
