   Kunming, PEOPLES R CHINA, 2001},
Abstract = {Preventing the inflow of municipal raw sewage by constructing a physical
   barrier-a necklace road, ameliorated some of the water quality
   characteristics of surfacewater of the littoral zone of the eutrophic
   Husainsagar Lake in Hyderabad city (south India). The pH, electrical
   conductivity, total hardness, magnesium, calcium, chlorides and
   dissolved oxygen contents of the water have increased and the
   Biochemical Oxygen Demand (BOD) has decreased in the water
   significantly. The benthic macroinvertebrate bioindicators of organic
   pollution have disappeared.},
