Title = {EFFECTS OF DIFFERENT UNDERLYING SURFACE ON THE SURFACE-AIR TEMPERATURE
   DISTRIBUTION IN GUANGZHOU},
Booktitle = {FIFTH INTERNATIONAL WORKSHOP ON ENERGY AND ENVIRONMENT OF RESIDENTIAL
   BUILDINGS AND THIRD INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON BUILT ENVIRONMENT AND
   PUBLIC HEALTH, VOL I AND II, PROCEEDINGS},
