   18-22, 1992},
Abstract = {This paper describes the application of the UK Department of Transport's
   air pollution prediction programme, PREDCO, to four urban street
   locations within the London area, each of which demonstrates restricted
   dispersion, characteristics. The development of approaches to predict CO
