   management of biomedical waste incorporates a waste reduction and
   neutralization component where appropriate. An attempt has been made to
   critically review the current biomedical waste management practices
   followed by the hospitals of Dolj District - Romania. In the paper the
   assessment of biomedical waste situation it is taken into account and
   the quantities of biomedical waste generated in I I hospitals pf Dolj
