   Univ Pharm \& Sci; Int Inst Knowledge Innovat \& Invent},
Abstract = {The purpose of this study is to investigate the emotions implied in the
   form of bentwood chairs, and to understand the design features of the
   product, for helping the planning of the future development of the
   market, and letting more people familiar with the beauty of bentwood
   chair.
   Based on the three levels of emotional design (visceral level, behavior
   level and reflection level), this study analyzed users' perception of
   products. The questionnaire survey and the focus groups method were
   employed to obtain the survey samples, and then the semantic
   differential method was used to understand the relationship between the
   bentwood chairs form and emotional vocabulary. The data were
   statistically analyzed by factor analysis and cluster analysis. The
   results of the survey were presented in the image map of cross analysis.
   The image of bentwood chair form was further analyzed and the design
   trend of bentwood chair was observed.
   The characteristics of bentwood chairs found out in this study were as
   follows. 1. The style of bentwood chairs was both plain and modern. 2.
   The overall form of bentwood chairs tended to be curry and streamline.
   3. The overall satisfaction with the comfort and practicality of
   bentwood chairs was low. 4. The usage environment of bentwood chairs
   mostly tended to be leisure. 5. The consumer preferences for the design
   of bentwood chair with explicit style were not easy to change over time.},
