   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {Chinese urbanization issues were analyzed from two aspects. On the one
   hand, segregation migrants were studied in labor market and housing
   conditions as invisible urbanization issue. On the other hand,
   over-afford housing price and urban sprawl were analyzed as prominent
   urbanization issue. The results show that urbanization issues arise is
   due to the breaking of harmonious relationship between subsystems of
   city.},
