Abstract = {The horsetail embroidery stripes originating from Shui Nationality in
   Sandu County of Guizhou Province acquired their inspiration from the
   butterfly stripes. The main cause of its emergence is attributed to the
   people's worship and respect of nature. The butterfly stripes tend to be
   smooth and flowing lines in symmetrical patterns which contain the
   expectations of the predecessors of Shui Nationality to pursue the
   well-being, health and wonderful life of their future generations. At
   last, it points out that the study on the butterfly stripes of Shui
   Nationality is conducive to the preservation and inheritance of the
   ancient traditional minority culture and is also vitally important to
   develop the tourism of Guizhou Province.},
