   Lab Analyt Chem; Univ Metz, Ctr Environ Sci},
Abstract = {The paper presents long-term observation of anionic detergents (AD) and
   phosphates (PO4-P) in waters of the Eastern Adriatic. Annual means of AD
   and PO4-P have shown that AD values are considerably higher (even
   double) in the vicinity of Sibenik and Split than elsewhere and up to
