Abstract = {A study on street planting was carried out in Shah Alam city. The
   importance of such study has become increasingly essential due to the
   public's awareness on landscape planting. The aim of this study is to
   compare the preferences of the public and the experts on the street
   planting composition. Using the Likert scale, 296 respondents evaluated
   the images of the street planting. The findings help to reduce the
   perceptual gap between the experts and the public thus, creating an
   environment that would be accepted by various groups of people. (C) 2015
